OL,3,GNEWSADelight as footbridge saved after
OL,4,Acommunity outcry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA footbridge which stretches over a
OL,7,Fbusy city centre route has been saved,
OL,8,Ffollowing concern losing it would
OL,9,Fimpact schoolchildren and commuters.
OL,11,FNational Highways originally planned to
OL,12,Fremove the 58-year-old Wyndham Road
OL,13,Fpedestrian bridge in Salisbury,
OL,14,FWiltshire, as part of a #23m package of
OL,15,Fworks on the A36.
OL,17,FBut a spokesperson said they had
OL,18,Flistened to feedback from locals and
OL,19,Fdecided to upgrade the structure rather
OL,20,Fthan remove it.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
