OL,3,GNEWSADelight as footbridge saved after
OL,4,Acommunity outcry
OL,5,
OL,6,FSalisbury City councillor Sharon
OL,7,FRideout, who campaigned to save the
OL,8,Fbridge, said she was "absolutely
OL,9,Fdelighted" and added: "They [National
OL,10,FHighways] listened, they heard and they
OL,11,Fdeveloped an understanding of the needs
OL,12,Fof our local community."
